  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "相机台上，同一个像高可以来自不同的物体。焦距 f = 2 固定。这一关的问题是：看到像有多高，能定出物体有多远吗？从几组（物高, 距离）里，选出像高都是 1、距离却各不相同的几组。",
        "en": "On the camera bench one image height can come from different objects. The focal length is fixed at f = 2. This level asks: does the height of an image tell how far away the object is? From several (height, depth) pairs, choose those that all image 1 tall at different depths."
      }
    }
  ],
